          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — science-informed wellness coaching rooted in habit frameworks and measurable outcomes.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fff8f2;\\n      --card:#fff7eb;\\n      --accent:#a4632a;\\n      --muted:#6b5747;\\n      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --max:1100px;\\n      font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;\\n      color:var(--muted);\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fffaf5);padding:36px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}\\n    .site{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 12px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6d9c1,#ffd3b0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(164,99,42,0.12)}\\n    .logo svg{width:32px;height:32px}\\n    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .tag{font-size:12px;color:#8b6f59}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px}\\n    nav a.active,nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(164,99,42,0.06)}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:18px}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(102,73,54,0.06)}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 16px;color:#6e5848}\\n    .contact-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .pill{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid rgba(110,88,72,0.06)}\\n    .pill strong{color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    /* aside: mini form */\\n    .aside{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf2);padding:22px;border-radius:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#6d5446}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:8px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(107,85,71,0.12);background:transparent}\\n    button.primary{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;font-weight:600;margin-top:10px}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:#957b66}\\n\\n    /* sections */\\n    section{margin-top:26px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}\\n    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border:1px solid rgba(110,88,72,0.04)}\\n    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent);font-size:16px}\\n    .card p{margin:0;color:#6e5848;font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* case studies */\\n    .case{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .avatar{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;flex:0 0 64px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffe9d8,#fbe3cc);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .case .meta{font-size:14px}\\n    .muted-small{font-size:13px;color:#8f7a67}\\n\\n    /* faq */\\n    .faq-item{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf5);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(110,88,72,0.04)}\\n\\n    footer{margin:40px 0 80px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#7b6452}\\n    .small{font-size:13px}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:880px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"site\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden>\\n          <!-- simple leaf mark -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <path d=\\\"M6 14C6 8 12 4 18 4\\\" stroke=\\\"#A4632A\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M6 14C10 18 18 20 20 18\\\" stroke=\\\"#D98F57\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"tag\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Meet</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"active\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- HERO -->\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <h2>Start with clarity, not pressure</h2>\\n        <p>I guide busy people through behavior-first systems that produce measurable energy, better sleep patterns, and sustainable daily routines. No fads — just small experiments, data points, and repeatable habits.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-info\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div aria-hidden style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff3ea,#ffe6d2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">📞</div><div><strong>Call</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">{{PHONE}}</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div aria-hidden style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff9ee,#fff1dc);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">✉️</div><div><strong>Email</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">{{EMAIL}}</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div aria-hidden style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff6f0,#ffeef0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">📍</div><div><strong>Local</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;text-align:center;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#faq\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(164,99,42,0.08)\\\">Ask a question</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <form action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"First &amp; last\\\" required />\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n          <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I'm most interested in</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option>Membership / ongoing coaching</option>\\n            <option>90-day intensive</option>\\n            <option>Workshop or corporate wellbeing</option>\\n            <option>Free guide / lead magnet</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Tell me briefly</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"A few sentences about your goals\\\"></textarea>\\n          <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Reach out</button>\\n        </form>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Prefer scheduling? <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">Book a discovery call</a>.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- MYTH VS TRUTH -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"myth-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"myth-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px\\\">Common misunderstandings about coaching</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Myth: Quick fixes stick</h3>\\n          <p>Reality: Short-term hacks disappear without habit scaffolding. We design repeatable micro-routines you can actually sustain.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Myth: You need perfect willpower</h3>\\n          <p>Reality: Systems beat willpower. Change environments, cues, and tiny daily rituals to change outcomes reliably.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Myth: Coaching is one-size-fits-all</h3>\\n          <p>Reality: I build frameworks tuned to your schedule, constraints, and measurable feedback — then iterate with data.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- PILLARS -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"pillars-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"pillars-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:14px 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px\\\">Core Habit Pillars I use with clients</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Rhythms</h3>\\n          <p>Create predictable daily slots for energy, recovery, and focus so decisions aren't made under fatigue.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Feedback</h3>\\n          <p>Small measurements guide weekly tweaks — sleep windows, movement minutes, and stress-reduction anchors.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Scaling</h3>\\n          <p>We test micro-changes, then compound them across weeks to convert habit into identity-aligned patterns.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CASE STUDIES -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"cases-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"cases-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:14px 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px\\\">Client pathways — examples of outcomes</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <!-- avatar svg unique to this page -->\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"14\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"26\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#fff2e6\\\" stroke=\\\"#e9c9ac\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M18 20c3-3 8-3 11 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#b36b3a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <strong>Rhythm Reset — 3 months</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Outcome: regular sleep schedule, 25% fewer midday energy crashes. Method: anchor + micro-sleep cues + weekly metrics.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"24\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#fff4e8\\\" stroke=\\\"#e9d0b8\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M16 30c4 2 9 2 12 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#b36b3a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <strong>Monthly Membership — ongoing</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Outcome: ongoing habit maintenance, quarterly goal reviews, and an adaptive framework you can scale. Model: subscription with coaching check-ins.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ -->\\n    <section id=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"faq-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:14px 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px\\\">Questions people ask before reaching out</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>How do I know coaching will fit my schedule?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">We map your current obligations on a 7-day grid and find <em>15–30 minute</em> windows for experiments. Most progress is made through small, consistent changes.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Is this a membership or a one-off program?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Both options exist. I offer intensive 8–12 week frameworks and an adaptive monthly membership for ongoing support and Quarterly Reviews.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>What happens in a discovery call?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">We clarify one measurable outcome, outline a 6-week experiment, and identify three habit levers you can implement immediately.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"cta-title\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 id=\\\"cta-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--accent)\\\">Join the Monthly Rhythm</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:#6e5848\\\">A membership model for steady progress: weekly check-ins, habit audits, and a private workbook. Cancel anytime.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:0 0 220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;text-align:center;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px\\\">See plans</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(164,99,42,0.08);text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)\\\">Book a session</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Evidence-framed coaching • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small UX touches\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page chunk for the wellness coach template.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — fully styled contact page in the earthy_warm design family\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace in the final build:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — your studio or coach business name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — short descriptive tagline\\n- {{PHONE}} — primary contact number\\n- {{EMAIL}} — primary contact email\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main call-to-action label (e.g., \\\"Book a call\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — URL for the primary CTA\\n- {{COACH_NAME}} — coach's display name\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}} — credentials line (e.g., \\\"MSc, Certified Coach\\\")\\n- {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — location display\\n\\nHow this page is organized:\\n- Header with logo, nav and a warm brand mark\\n- Hero introducing the contact intent and multiple contact channels\\n- Myth vs Truth section to manage expectations before clients reach out\\n- Pillars section that communicates core frameworks (rhythms, feedback, scaling)\\n- Case studies area with short client pathway blurbs\\n- FAQ tailored specifically to contacting and commitment model\\n- CTA promoting the membership model and links to pricing & booking\\n\\nDesign notes and customizations:\\n- The page follows the \\\"earthy_warm\\\" layout family: warm tones, rounded cards, organic spacing.\\n- No external fonts or assets are referenced here. For richer visuals, place SVGs and images into assets/img/.\\n- Accessibility: use semantic headings, labeled inputs, and sufficient color contrast for text hierarchy.\\n\\nIntegration tips:\\n- Ensure nav links in header match the file names across the project: index.html, about.html, programs.html, services.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html\\n- Replace the mailto form action if you integrate with a backend endpoint or a form provider.\\n- For membership handling, link the CTA to the pricing or checkout flow ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}).\\n\\nAssets:\\n- This chunk does not include external SVG files. The full project expects visual assets (hero, avatar, pattern) under assets/img/ as separate files in other chunks. If you prefer, you can inline SVGs or place them at assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg and assets/img/pattern.svg and update links accordingly.\\n\\nEditing guidance:\\n- Keep the habit-centric language and outcome-focused copy. Avoid medical claims.\\n- Match the scientific guide voice: be analytical, warm, and explain frameworks clearly.\\n- When updating colors, keep the accent and text contrast to maintain readability and a premium feel.\\n\\nIf you need a version of this page with a different nav label set or alternate ordering of sections for A/B tests, request a variant and specify which labels or header ordering you prefer.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
